{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt; SURVIVE, ENTERTAIN, ESCAPE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome back to another exciting episode of the Oddinary Farm Show!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, the viewer, will look deeply into the tiny, feeble human mind as they struggle to survive on a mysterious island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together or alone, they must farm, explore, and gather coins. Why? To purchase a hot air balloon, their only hope of escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware, the island is far from peaceful. Bizarre and deadly creatures lurk in the shadows, ready to test the peak silliness of our contestants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will they survive each night and make it before their inevitable doom?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab some human popcorn, sit back, and find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IT'S SHOWTIME!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt; KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Arcade-style Farming</strong>: wiki free</i>, straight to the point, satisfying farming system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Animal Taming &amp; Management</i></strong>: Capture quirky animals around the island to help boost the productivity of the farm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Exploration &amp; Foraging</strong></i>: Farming is not the only way to get rich. Discover the wealth of the islands and escape in your own style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Building &amp; Defense</i></strong>: Use common farming equipment such as turrets, landmines, and  reinforced concrete walls to fend off unwanted guests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Single Player or Online Co-op</i></strong>: More friends, more ways to die. Or die alone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Procedurally Generated Maps</strong></i>: Vibrant living world where two runs technically never be the same.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3848990?t=1772852563","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3848990?t=1772852563","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848990/1689a0801cc42e8f770716c76f02e1aad32900d2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772852563","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848990/1689a0801cc42e8f770716c76f02e1aad32900d2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772852563","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt; SURVIVE, ENTERTAIN, ESCAPE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome back to another exciting episode of the Oddinary Farm Show!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, the viewer, will look deeply into the tiny, feeble human mind as they struggle to survive on a mysterious island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together or alone, they must farm, explore, and gather coins. Why? To purchase a hot air balloon, their only hope of escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware, the island is far from peaceful. Bizarre and deadly creatures lurk in the shadows, ready to test the peak silliness of our contestants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will they survive each night and make it before their inevitable doom?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab some human popcorn, sit back, and find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IT'S SHOWTIME!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt; KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Arcade-style Farming</strong>: wiki free</i>, straight to the point, satisfying farming system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Animal Taming &amp; Management</i></strong>: Capture quirky animals around the island to help boost the productivity of the farm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Exploration &amp; Foraging</strong></i>: Farming is not the only way to get rich. Discover the wealth of the islands and escape in your own style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Building &amp; Defense</i></strong>: Use common farming equipment such as turrets, landmines, and  reinforced concrete walls to fend off unwanted guests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Single Player or Online Co-op</i></strong>: More friends, more ways to die. Or die alone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Procedurally Generated Maps</strong></i>: Vibrant living world where two runs technically never be the same.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Spring Rolls Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848990/5188a7651a492279217b2fe75920766852e9b797/header.jpg?t=1772852563","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3848990/204339751/27911a6fafeb42bb7d76cfd567ac30907fbb0250/1758499274/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758500479","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3848990/204339751/27911a6fafeb42bb7d76cfd567ac30907fbb0250/1758499274/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758500479","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3848990/204339751/27911a6fafeb42bb7d76cfd567ac30907f